{"id":"vod_md_3604","vodId":"3604","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"刀语","name_cn":"刀语","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230828-1/61fd421651e8ba1ab89a4e78c0fc504c.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在中世纪的日本，鑢七花（细谷佳正 配音）是一个外表强壮头脑简单的男子，生于武术世家的他背负着传承“虚刀流”的重任。从小到大，鑢七花便被当做一把刀来培养，这种变态的教育方式使得他最终走上了弑亲的悲剧道路。在奇策士咎儿（田村由加利 配音）的鼓动和怂恿下，鑢七花踏上了漫漫的修炼之路，他要找到锻制师四季崎记纪（森功至 配音）所锻造的12把名刀，来增强自己的实力。一路上，鑢七花遇上了各式各样的敌人，别无选择的他只得一一将他们斩杀。然而，当身边的亲人和朋友接连死去的时候，愚钝的鑢七花开始思考起作为一把刀的价值和意义。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-28 08:04:36","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/RAKdb51n/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/WT2MsC9s/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/mtCSpuVJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/IUy5VgSJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/CpkVeqxc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/nrcQkktL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/mvyWjxf5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/JRN9y2T2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/JbZ9FxVl/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/xiIhcbZu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/0zwMwSdD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/E3XwllrL/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:36:27.010Z"}